## 🛠️ Stack technique

| Composant | Technologie |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Langage** | Python 3.9+ |
| **Serveur** | Gunicorn + Flask |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions (Node 24) |
| **Conteneur** | Docker (Debian slim) |
| **Tests** | pytest + coverage |
| **Lint** | flake8 + ruff + mypy |
| **Sécurité** | bandit |
| **Format** | black + isort |

